<p>Hello! I honestly love writing SCPs, so I'm glad an idea finally came to me. Fun fact, I drew girl.png's original design on my phone while I was half asleep. Fun, huh?</p>
<p>Anyways, I hope you enjoy this sweet story about a computer virus with the mind of a child that just likes to help people. I was trying to capture the nature of how sometimes kids will destroy things thinking their helping, when in reality they aren't. I hope I managed to do that!</p>
